# turbo-context-budget-watch
owner: turbofit-runtime-scout · cadence: every 5m · status: SUGGESTED
**Want a repeatable check that compares Hermes prompt size against the stable 65K cap before each request so 131K only happens when you actually need long context?**

## Prompt
Inspect recent Hermes prompt lengths and warn if a candidate request would exceed 65K before firing it against MTPLX/Unleashed/Ornith; do not block, only surface the evidence.

## Evidence
> requested context 131072 exceeds the machine fit 8192
> My recommendation: Lock in 65K context at ~7 tok/s as the daily driver.
